  "summary": "SHELBY is a .NET malware family consisting of SHELBYLOADER and SHELBYC2 components that abuse GitHub for command and control. The malware establishes persistence via the Run registry key, performs extensive sandbox checks, and exfiltrates system information. Its reliance on a hardcoded GitHub Personal Access Token (PAT) for C2 access represents a significant operational security flaw.",
